  "在預覽畫面上拖曳遮罩框：框內移動、把手縮放（Shift 等比）、上方圓點旋轉、右側菱形羽化": "Drag the mask box in the preview: inside to move, handles to resize (Shift keeps aspect), top dot to rotate, right diamond to feather",
  "拖曳移動、拖把手調整大小（角 = 等比，Ctrl 自由縮放、Alt 以中心縮放；Shift 吸附到中線 / 邊緣 / 網格線）、上方圓點旋轉、右側菱形羽化": "Drag to move; handles resize (corners keep aspect, Ctrl = free, Alt = from center; Shift snaps to center lines / edges / grid lines); top dot rotates; right diamond feathers",
  "拖曳調整羽化": "Drag to adjust feather",
  "{0}（拖到影片軌）": "{0} (drag to a video track)",
  "純色背景素材：拖到影片軌；或選顏色後按「加到結尾」": "Solid color media: drag to a video track, or pick a color and press \"Append\"",
  "拖到影片軌，或按右上角 ＋ 加在播放頭。選取後在「屬性」修改文字與樣式": "Drag to a video track, or press ＋ at the top right to add at the playhead. Edit text and style in Properties",
  "點一下試看 · 拖到時間軸套用（右鍵有更多套用方式）": "Click to try · drag onto the timeline to apply (right-click for more)",
  "把聲音分開成獨立的音訊片段": "Split the sound into a separate audio clip",
  "連結的音訊（右鍵「取消影音連結」可以分開成獨立的音訊片段）": "Linked audio (right-click \"Unlink audio/video\" to make it a separate audio clip)",
  "刪除 {0} 條軌道": "Delete {0} tracks",
  "選取的 {0} 條軌道上還有 {1} 個項目，會一起被刪除（可以用 Ctrl+Z 復原）。": "The {0} selected tracks still have {1} item(s); they will be deleted too (Ctrl+Z to undo).",
  "點軌道標籤選取軌道後按 Delete 會刪除選取的軌道（多選時一起刪，鎖定的軌道也會刪；上面有東西時會先確認）；右鍵「刪除軌道」也一樣。點片段或軌道空白處之後，Delete 就回到刪除片段。": "After clicking a track label, Delete removes the selected tracks (all of them when multi-selected; locked tracks too; you are asked first if they have items). Right-click → \"Delete track\" does the same. After clicking a clip or an empty lane, Delete deletes clips again.",
  "素材存檔失敗：{0}": "Failed to save media: {0}",
  "找不到可用的音訊編碼設定": "No usable audio encoder configuration found",
  "素材資訊": "Media info",
