  "詳細資訊": "Details",
  "關閉音訊反應": "Turn off audio reactivity",
  "訊號": "Signal",
  "另外疊加 {0} 個特效": "{0} more effects stacked",
  "在素材庫單擊特效或轉場，會在「預覽」用示範的 A / B 畫面循環試看（轉場是 A 換到 B）；再點一次從頭播，點素材庫的空白處停止。拖曳到時間軸套用，右鍵有更多套用方式。": "Click an effect or transition in the library to loop it in Preview on the sample A / B frames (a transition goes from A to B); click it again to play from the start, or click an empty spot in the library to stop. Drag it onto the timeline to apply; right-click for more options.",
  "想看套在自己畫面上的樣子：Alt+點擊卡片，或右鍵 →「用時間軸畫面試看」。特效疊在播放頭這一格上；轉場如果播放頭停在同一條影片軌兩個相連片段的剪接點上，會用前一段的尾巴和後一段的開頭來預覽（優先用選中的軌道），不然後一段用 B 畫面代替。": "To see it on your own footage, Alt+click the card or right-click → \"Preview on timeline\". Effects are layered on the frame at the playhead; for a transition, if the playhead is on a cut between two adjacent clips on a video track, the preview uses the end of the first clip and the start of the second (the selected track is checked first); otherwise the B frame stands in for the second clip.",
  "用時間軸畫面試看": "Preview on timeline",
