  "片段遮罩 Clip Mask": "Clip Mask",
  "拖曳到任何位置調整順序（影片 / 特效 / 音訊軌可以交錯），下緣拖曳調整高度，右鍵更多選項": "Drag anywhere to reorder (video / effect / audio tracks can be mixed), drag the bottom edge to resize, right-click for more",
