  "套用到下一段": "Applies to next segment",
  "也可以直接拖到「屬性」面板，套用到目前選取的片段；或按屬性面板最下面的「加入片段特效…」從特效庫挑。": "You can also drop onto the Properties panel to apply to the selected clip, or use \"Add clip effect…\" at the bottom of Properties to pick from the library.",
  "素材遺失時（紅色）：點素材重新選檔，或把新素材拖到時間軸上的紅色片段。": "Missing media (red): click it to pick the file again, or drag new media onto the red clip in the timeline.",
  "片段前面沒有緊貼的片段時，進場轉場是從透明轉入（在最底層軌道看起來就是從黑畫面轉入）；結尾的轉出是轉到透明。後面緊貼著片段時轉出不會生效，請改用下一個片段的進場轉場。": "When nothing sits right before a clip, its intro transitions in from transparent (on the bottom track that looks like coming in from black); an outro at the end transitions out to transparent. An outro has no effect when another clip follows right after — use that clip's intro instead.",
  "自訂模組在「程式碼」分頁編輯：改完按「儲存」（Ctrl+S）才會套用，⋯ 選單可以捨棄變更。內建模組不能直接改，請先「複製為新模組」。": "Custom modules are edited in the Code tab: changes apply only when you press Save (Ctrl+S); the ⋯ menu can discard changes. Built-in modules can't be edited directly — use \"Duplicate as new module\" first.",
  "「遮罩」分頁是形狀庫：點一下套用到選取的片段（設定片段的遮罩）或特效（換形狀），也可以拖到時間軸的片段 / 特效上。滑到形狀上點星號加入我的最愛。": "The Mask tab is a shape library: click a shape to apply it to the selected clip (sets its mask) or effect (changes its shape), or drag it onto a clip / effect in the timeline. Hover a shape and click the star to favorite it.",
  "右上角 ＋ 可以匯入自訂形狀（PNG / SVG）：透明背景的圖用透明度，沒有透明背景就用亮度（白色 = 保留）。": "Use ＋ at the top right to import a custom shape (PNG / SVG): images with transparency use their alpha; otherwise brightness is used (white = keep).",
  "捨棄變更？": "Discard changes?",
  "「{0}」還沒儲存。": "\"{0}\" hasn't been saved.",
