  "儲存 (Ctrl+S)": "Save (Ctrl+S)",
  "新增的模組第一次儲存後才會出現在素材庫。程式碼分頁可以同時開好幾個模組（中鍵關閉），關閉還沒儲存的分頁會先詢問。": "A new module appears in the library only after its first save. The Code tab can hold several modules at once (middle-click to close); closing an unsaved one asks first.",
