  "系統顏色選擇器": "System color picker",
  "調色盤：在色塊上拖曳調飽和度與亮度、下方滑桿調色相，也可以直接輸入色碼或用系統顏色選擇器。色板右鍵可以加入我的最愛或從色板移除。": "Color picker: drag in the square to set saturation and brightness, use the slider below for hue, or type a hex code or use the system color picker. Right-click a swatch to add it to favorites or remove it from the colors.",
  "關鍵影格時間軸跟時間軸一樣：在右側按住 Ctrl 滾動滾輪縮放（以游標為中心），滾輪左右捲動（方向照「設定 → 時間軸 → 滾輪捲動方向」，Shift / Alt 換方向）；放大後最下面有水平捲軸。": "The keyframe timeline works like the main timeline: hold Ctrl and scroll on the right side to zoom (centred on the pointer); the wheel scrolls sideways (direction follows Settings → Timeline → Wheel scroll direction, Shift / Alt switches it). When zoomed in, a horizontal scrollbar appears at the bottom.",
  // ── AI 去背 / 色板 ──
  "AI 去背": "AI Background Removal",
  "啟用": "Enabled",
  "狀態": "Status",
  "重試": "Retry",
  "色板的最後一個（有調色盤圖示）是調色盤目前的顏色，可以直接拖到時間軸；點它會在右邊打開調色盤（✕ 關閉）。按「加入色板」或上方的 ＋ 把它存進色板。點色板裡的顏色會在「預覽」試看，不會改變調色盤的顏色。": "The last swatch (marked with a palette icon) is the color picker's current color and can be dragged straight to the timeline; click it to open the picker on the right (✕ closes it). Add to colors or the + at the top saves it to the colors. Clicking a swatch previews it in Preview without changing the picker color.",
  "AI 去背：選取影片或圖片片段，在「屬性 → AI 去背」打開開關。第一次會載入 U²-Netp 模型，接著在背景逐格算出遮罩（每秒 24 格，只算片段用到的部分），算好前預覽照原樣顯示；結果會存起來，重新整理不用再算。匯出時會先等遮罩全部算完。計算中時間軸上的片段底部會顯示進度條（失敗是紅色，滑過去看原因）。": "AI background removal: select a video or image clip and turn on Properties → AI Background Removal. The U²-Netp model loads the first time, then masks are computed frame by frame in the background (24 per second, only for the part the clip uses). Until they are ready the preview shows the clip unchanged. Results are saved, so reloading does not recompute them. Export waits until all masks are done. While computing, a progress bar runs along the bottom of the clip on the timeline (red = failed; hover for the reason).",
  // ── 鋼筆工具 ──
