  "寫一個跟著節拍閃爍的特效": "Write an effect that flashes on the beat",
  "AI 可以自己讀內建模組和你做的模組的程式碼來參考，例如「照內建的圓形擴散做一個方形版本」；讀過的模組會列在回覆上方的「參考」。": "The AI can read the code of built-in modules and your own modules on its own, e.g. \"make a square version of the built-in Iris\"; modules it read are listed under \"Read\" above the reply.",
  "新增特效 {0} ×{1}": "Add effect {0} ×{1}",
