  "已套用 {0} 項，{1} 項已不存在": "Applied {0}, {1} no longer exist",
  "在每個重拍加震動": "Add shake on every downbeat",
  "AI 也可以改專案，例如「在每個重拍加震動」「所有接點換成甩鏡」「副歌那段加速」：它會先讀時間軸和節拍，把要做的修改列在回覆下方，按「套用」才會執行，整批算一步，可以 Ctrl+Z 復原。片段被刪掉或移走的項目會跳過。": "The AI can also edit the project, e.g. \"add shake on every downbeat\", \"use whip pan at every cut\", \"speed up the chorus\": it reads the timeline and beats first and lists the changes below its reply. Nothing happens until you press Apply; the whole batch is one undo step (Ctrl+Z). Items whose clips were deleted or moved are skipped.",
