  "節拍格線": "Beat grid",
  "沒有節拍：先在音訊軌放音樂": "No beats: put music on an audio track first",
  "先選取要分割的片段": "Select the clips to split first",
  "已在節拍處切 {0} 刀": "Split at {0} beats",
