  "先選取要排列的片段": "Select the clips to arrange first",
  "排不下：會蓋到其他片段": "Doesn't fit: it would cover other clips",
  "已依節拍排列 {0} 個片段": "Arranged {0} clips on beats",
  "音訊軌上的音樂會自動偵測節拍：音訊片段下緣的短刻度是每一拍、青色長刻度是重拍（每小節第一拍），重拍也會畫成跨過所有軌道的細線。拖曳、修剪時會吸附到節拍。": "Music on audio tracks is beat-detected automatically: short ticks along the bottom of the audio clip are beats, long teal ticks are downbeats (first beat of each bar), and downbeats are also drawn as thin lines across all tracks. Dragging and trimming snap to beats.",
  "工具列的「節拍」選單（或片段右鍵 →「節拍」）：「在節拍處分割」把選取的片段在每拍 / 每 2 拍 / 每小節切開；「依節拍排列」把選取的片段從最近的一拍開始依序接上，每段 1 拍、2 拍、1 小節或 2 小節，素材不夠長就停在素材結尾、下一段從下一拍開始。連結的原音會一起移動。": "The toolbar \"Beats\" menu (or right-click a clip → \"Beats\"): \"Split at beats\" cuts the selected clips at every beat / every 2 beats / every bar; \"Arrange on beats\" lines the selected clips up from the nearest beat, 1 beat, 2 beats, 1 bar or 2 bars each. If a clip's media is too short it ends there and the next one starts on the next beat. Linked audio moves along.",
  "音效之類不想當節拍來源的音訊，在屬性面板關掉「節拍格線」；屬性面板也會顯示偵測到的 BPM。很快的歌可能會偵測成一半的速度（例如 174 → 87），剪接時一樣對得上。": "For audio you don't want as a beat source (sound effects, etc.), turn off \"Beat grid\" in Properties, which also shows the detected BPM. Very fast songs may be detected at half speed (e.g. 174 → 87); cuts still line up.",
  "選取同一軌的上 / 下一個片段": "Select the previous / next clip on the same track",
  "往旁邊延伸選取": "Extend the selection sideways",
  "選取軌道上第一個 / 最後一個片段（加 Shift = 一路選到頭 / 尾）": "Select the first / last clip on the track (with Shift: select all the way to the start / end)",
  "換到上 / 下一條軌道的片段": "Move to the clip on the track above / below",
  "「色板」分頁放純色背景：拖到影片軌，或雙擊色塊插入到播放頭。色板不會出現在「素材」分頁，也不會遺失。": "The Colors tab holds solid-color backgrounds: drag one to a video track, or double-click a swatch to insert it at the playhead. Colors don't appear in the Media tab and never go missing.",
  "素材或色板「插入到播放頭」時：選中的軌道在播放頭有空位就放那裡，被佔用就在它下方新增一條軌道。": "\"Insert at playhead\" for media or colors: it goes on the selected track if there is room at the playhead; otherwise a new track is added right below it.",
