  "存成組合": "Save as combo",
  "存成組合…": "Save as combo…",
  "已存成組合": "Saved as combo",
  "從特效庫挑一個特效，疊加在這個方塊上": "Pick an effect to stack on this block",
  "我的組合": "My combos",
  "整段一次": "Once",
  "每個剪接點": "Every cut",
  "每半拍": "Every half beat",
  "沒有選取其他片段": "No other clips selected",
  "疊加": "Stack",
  "觸發": "Trigger",
  "選取的特效": "Selected effects",
  "重新命名組合": "Rename combo",
  "重新播放": "Restart",
  "片段的屬性也能套用到同軌（同一條影片軌上的同類片段，文字只對文字）或選取的片段：數值欄右鍵可選目前的值或含關鍵影格（關鍵影格時間照原樣）；運動、不透明度、畫面區塊的標題按右鍵可以複製 / 貼上整組（例如縮放 X、Y 一起），或整組套用；片段名稱列按右鍵可以複製 / 貼上全部屬性（運動、不透明度、畫面、片段特效；貼到所有選取的片段）。": "Clip properties can also be applied on the track (clips of the same kind on the same video track; text only to text) or to the selected clips: right-click a value to use the current value or include keyframes (keyframe times are kept); right-click the Motion, Opacity or Frame section title to copy / paste the whole group (e.g. Scale X and Y together) or apply it; right-click the clip name bar to copy / paste all attributes (motion, opacity, frame, clip effects; pasted to every selected clip).",
  "在特效的標題列按右鍵可以複製 / 貼上整個特效（種類、參數、關鍵影格；遮罩保留原本的），也能套用到同軌或選取的項目：效果軌上的特效可以套用到同軌的相同特效、其他特效或全部；片段特效可以套用到同一條影片軌上已有這個特效的片段、還沒有的片段（會加上去）或全部片段。轉場的屬性與標題列也可以複製 / 貼上、套用到選取的轉場。": "Right-click an effect's title bar to copy / paste the whole effect (type, parameters and keyframes; the target keeps its own mask), or apply it on the track or to the selected items: an effect on an FX track can be applied to the same effect, other effects or all effects on that track; a clip effect can be applied to clips on the same video track that already have it, clips that don't (it is added) or all clips. Transition properties and title bars can also be copied / pasted and applied to the selected transitions.",
  "特效分頁的「組合」是疊好的整組特效：衝擊型（變速重擊、動漫衝擊、故障切點…）放在 drop 或剪接點上打一下；節拍型（每拍彈跳、節拍閃光…）拉滿整段會每拍重播；氛圍型（電影感、夢幻柔光、錄影帶回憶…）整段放著改變氣氛。特效方塊的名稱列按右鍵「存成組合…」，會把整組（疊加的特效、觸發、遮罩、長度）存成「我的組合」。組合拖到效果軌就放上整組、拖到片段上變成片段特效、單擊試看；我的組合右鍵可以重新命名或刪除。": "Combos in the Effects tab are ready-made effect stacks: impact combos (Velocity Hit, Anime Impact, Glitch Cut…) hit once on a drop or cut; beat combos (Beat Bounce, Beat Flash…) restart on every beat when stretched over a section; mood combos (Cinematic, Dreamy Glow, VHS Memory…) stay on to change the atmosphere. Right-click an effect block's name bar and choose Save as combo… to save the whole set (stacked effects, trigger, mask, length) as My combos. Drag a combo to an FX track to place the whole set, onto a clip to add clip effects, click to preview; right-click My combos to rename or delete.",
  "{0} 個素材": "{0} media",
  "匯入失敗：{0}": "Import failed: {0}",
  "素材清理失敗": "Media cleanup failed",
  "預估大小": "Estimated size",
  "影片軌": "Video tracks",
  "音訊軌": "Audio tracks",
  "轉場方塊": "Transition block",
  "一個特效方塊可以疊加好幾個特效：在屬性面板最下面按「加入特效…」，或直接從特效分頁拖到屬性面板（按住 Alt 放開 = 取代主特效），依序套用，可以開關、上下移、移除。「觸發」可以讓方塊每半拍、每拍、每 2 拍、每小節或每個剪接點從頭再播一次（關鍵影格也從每次觸發開始算），一個方塊拉滿整段就能卡在每一拍上；選「每個剪接點」時可以挑要看哪幾條影片軌（預設是這條效果軌下面的全部）。時間軸上的細線是觸發的位置。衝擊特效（有閃電的）每次觸發只打一下（模組設定的長度），打完就停到下一次觸發，不會被拉長到下一拍。": "An effect block can stack several effects: press Add effect… at the bottom of Properties, or drag an effect from the Effects tab onto Properties (hold Alt when releasing to replace the main effect); they apply in order and can be toggled, moved or removed. Trigger restarts the block every half beat, beat, 2 beats, bar, or at every cut (keyframes also count from each trigger), so one block stretched over a whole section hits every beat; with Every cut you can choose which video tracks to follow (by default all video tracks below this FX track). The thin lines on the timeline mark the triggers. Impact effects (the ones with a bolt) play just one hit per trigger (the module's own length), then wait for the next trigger instead of stretching to the next beat.",
  "特效拖到效果軌 = 調整圖層（作用在它下面的影片軌）；拖到影片 / 文字片段上 = 只作用在那個片段的片段特效。拖到效果軌上已經有的方塊時跟素材一樣，放開後可選「覆蓋」「插入」「取代」等；按住 Alt 拖到方塊上則直接取代。": "Drag an effect onto an FX track = adjustment layer (affects the video tracks below it); onto a video / text clip = a clip effect for that clip only. Dropping onto an existing block works like media: choose Overwrite, Insert, Replace, etc. after releasing; hold Alt while dropping onto a block to replace it directly.",
  "把轉場拖到效果軌會變成「轉場方塊」：方塊範圍內、選定影片軌上的每個剪接點都自動套用這個轉場（片段自己有轉場的優先），剪接點變了會自動跟上，改方塊的參數就是全部一起改。按住 Alt 把轉場拖到轉場方塊上可以換種類；時間軸上的橘線是會套用轉場的剪接點。": "Drag a transition onto an FX track to create a transition block: every cut on the chosen video tracks within the block gets this transition automatically (a clip's own transition wins), it follows when cuts change, and editing the block changes them all at once. Hold Alt and drag a transition onto a transition block to change its type; the orange lines on the timeline mark the cuts that get the transition.",
  "效果": "FX",
