  "預覽控制列「⋯」裡的相機按鈕會把目前這一格用輸出解析度存成 PNG，直接加到素材庫（不含素材庫的試看畫面）。": "The camera button in the ⋯ menu of the preview controls saves the current frame as a PNG at output resolution and adds it to the media library (library previews are not included).",
  '軌道標籤或軌道空白處按右鍵 →「新增軌道」可以直接在這條軌道下方加一條影片、效果或音訊軌；「新增軌道…」可以一次新增好幾條。': 'Right-click a track label or empty track area → "Add tracks" to add a video, effects or audio track right below it; "Add tracks…" adds several at once.',
