  "觸發時間": "Trigger times",
  "觸發選「手動」時，觸發區塊下面會出現「觸發時間」方塊列，跟片段特效的「作用」列一樣操作：每個方塊是一次觸發，從哪開始、播多長自己排，方塊之間特效不作用（拖曳、雙擊新增、Delete、Ctrl+C / V / D、Q / W、Ctrl+B 都能用）。從其他觸發方式切過去時，目前的觸發點會展開成方塊；隨機位置、隨機運鏡會每個方塊換一個點。": "With the trigger set to \"Manual\", a \"Trigger times\" lane appears under the trigger section. It works like the \"Active\" lane of clip effects: each block is one trigger, you choose where it starts and how long it plays, and the effect is off between blocks (drag, double-click to add, Delete, Ctrl+C / V / D, Q / W and Ctrl+B all work). Switching from another trigger turns the current trigger points into blocks; Random position and Random Camera move to a new spot for each block.",
  "延伸到下次觸發": "Extend to next trigger",
  "隨機位置": "Random position",
  "觸發的「延伸到下次觸發」（只有衝擊特效有）讓特效不在原本的長度停住，曲線一路跑到下一次觸發前；「隨機位置」讓有「中心」的特效（衝擊波、RGB 變焦、縮放殘影…包含疊加的）每次觸發換到隨機一個點，「邊距」決定離畫面邊緣多遠，會蓋過追蹤的位置。": "\"Extend to next trigger\" (impact effects only) keeps the effect from stopping at its own length; its curve runs all the way to the next trigger. \"Random position\" moves the center of effects that have one (Shockwave, Chromatic Zoom, Zoom Echo…, including stacked ones) to a random spot on every trigger; \"Margin\" sets how far from the edges. It overrides tracking.",
  "放大": "Zoom",
  "放大隨機": "Zoom variation",
  "邊距": "Margin",
  "傾斜（度）": "Tilt (°)",
  "動態模糊": "Motion blur",
  "「隨機運鏡」配合觸發使用：每次觸發推到畫面上隨機一個點（帶一點傾斜），下一次觸發再移過去，每次運鏡會一路延伸到下一次觸發前；「邊距」決定離畫面邊緣多遠，「隨機種子」換一組位置。沒設觸發時整個方塊只推一次。": "\"Random Camera\" works with triggers: on every trigger it pushes in to a random spot on the frame (with a slight tilt), then moves to a new spot on the next trigger; each move eases all the way until the next trigger. \"Margin\" keeps the spots away from the edges; \"Seed\" picks a different set of spots. Without a trigger it moves only once per block.",
  "設了觸發的方塊裡，u_trigger 是第幾次觸發（0 起算）。": "In a block with a trigger, u_trigger is the trigger number (starting at 0).",
