  "RGB 分離 RGB Split": "RGB Split",
  '按住 Ctrl 點軌道標籤或軌道空白處可以多選軌道，Shift 點選取一段範圍，直接點只選那一條；點選片段會改成只選片段所在的軌道。拖曳其中一條軌道標籤會整組一起移動（保持原本的上下順序），右鍵「移到最上方 / 最下方」也會整組移動。': 'Ctrl-click track labels or empty track space to select several tracks, Shift-click to select a range, plain click to select just one; clicking a clip selects only its track. Dragging one track label moves the whole group (keeping their order), and right-click "Move to top / bottom" also moves the group.',
  "衝擊特效": "Hit effect",
  '軌道高度': 'Track height',
  '預設與新增的軌道': 'Default and new tracks',
