  '大': 'Large',
  '設定的變更還沒儲存。': 'Your settings changes have not been saved.',
  '形狀的變更還沒儲存。': 'Your shape changes have not been saved.',
  '設定、匯出、繪製形狀等視窗也一樣：Ctrl+Enter 完成 / 套用；Esc 或點視窗外面是取消，有還沒儲存的變更時會先確認。': 'Other windows such as Settings, Export and Draw Shape work the same: Ctrl+Enter finishes / applies; Esc or clicking outside cancels, asking first if there are unsaved changes.',
  "自動儲存": "Autosave",
  "關閉後按 Ctrl+S 存檔": "When off, press Ctrl+S to save",
  "專案預設會自動儲存在這個瀏覽器；在「設定 → 自動儲存」關掉後只有 Ctrl+S（檔案 → 立即存檔）才會存，有沒存的變更時關閉分頁會先提醒。": "Projects autosave in this browser by default. Turn off \"Settings → Autosave\" to save only with Ctrl+S (File → Save now); closing the tab with unsaved changes then asks first.",
  "特效卡片右下角有閃電的是衝擊特效（衝擊變焦、閃白、Shake…）：打一下就結束，適合放在鼓點上，拉長會變慢、失去衝擊感。沒有閃電的是持續特效（調色、描邊、手持晃動…），放多長都一樣。自訂模組在程式碼加一行 // @hit 就會標成衝擊特效。": "Effect cards with a lightning bolt in the corner are hit effects (Crash Zoom, Flash, Shake…): they play once and end, so put them on beats — stretching them makes them slow and loses the punch. Effects without it are sustained (Grade, Outline, Handheld…) and look the same at any length. Add a line // @hit to a custom module to mark it as a hit effect.",
  "衝擊": "Hit",
  "持續": "Sustained",
  "作用": "Active",
  "整段": "Whole clip",
  "手動": "Manual",
  "在播放頭觸發": "Trigger at playhead",
  "每拍觸發": "Trigger on beats",
  "轉成手動": "Convert to manual",
  "片段特效的「作用」列決定特效什麼時候跑：「整段」= 整個片段都套用；「手動」= 只在時間軸那一欄的方塊裡作用，每個方塊是一次獨立播放（拖中間移動、拖兩端改長度、雙擊空白處新增、Delete 刪除；Ctrl / Shift + 點可以多選；其他操作跟時間軸一樣：Ctrl+C / X / V 複製、剪下、貼到播放頭，Ctrl+D 在後面緊接著再製一份，跟後面的重疊就覆蓋；Home / End 跳到選取方塊的頭尾，Ctrl+← / → 換一個，Alt+← / → 移動一格，Q / W 修剪到播放頭，Ctrl+B（或 S）在播放頭切開；拖曳會對齊時間軸格線，磁吸開著時吸附播放頭、旁邊的方塊與節拍）；「每半拍 / 每拍 / 每 2 拍 / 每小節」= 片段範圍內每遇到一拍就播一次，左邊的秒數是每次多長，節拍或片段移動會自動跟上，右鍵「轉成手動」可以展開成方塊個別調整。衝擊特效加到片段上時預設只在片段開頭打一下。不作用的時候特效完全不算，比較省效能；參數的關鍵影格仍然照片段內時間。": "A clip effect's Active row sets when it runs: Whole clip = the entire clip; Manual = only inside the blocks in the timeline column, each block one separate playback (drag the middle to move, drag the ends to change length, double-click empty space to add, Delete to remove; Ctrl / Shift + click selects several; everything else works like the timeline: Ctrl+C / X / V copies, cuts and pastes at the playhead, Ctrl+D duplicates right after the block and overwrites whatever it overlaps; Home / End jumps to the selected block's start / end, Ctrl+← / → selects the previous / next one, Alt+← / → moves by a frame, Q / W trims to the playhead, Ctrl+B (or S) splits at the playhead; dragging follows the timeline grid and, with snapping on, snaps to the playhead, neighbouring blocks and beats); Every half beat / beat / 2 beats / bar = plays once on every beat within the clip, the seconds field on the left is how long each lasts, and it follows beat or clip changes automatically — right-click → Convert to manual expands it into blocks you can adjust individually. Hit effects added to a clip default to a single hit at the clip start. While inactive the effect isn't computed at all, which saves performance; parameter keyframes still use clip time.",
  "時間軸格線": "Timeline grid",
  "拖曳、吸附、節拍的最小單位": "Smallest step for dragging, snapping and beats",
  "「設定 → 時間軸格線」決定時間軸的最小單位（1/30 或 1/60 秒）：拖曳、修剪、吸附、節拍格線、方向鍵逐格都照這一格走。匯出 30 fps 時選 1/30，節拍和片段的位置就會剛好落在匯出的影格上；改了以後，已經放好的片段不會自動移動。": "Settings → Timeline grid sets the smallest timeline step (1/30 or 1/60 s): dragging, trimming, snapping, the beat grid and arrow-key frame stepping all follow it. Choose 1/30 when exporting at 30 fps so beats and clips land exactly on exported frames. Changing it does not move clips that are already placed.",
  "關鍵影格 {0} ×{1}": "Keyframes {0} ×{1}",
