  "AI 導演分配素材…": "AI Director is assigning media…",
  "AI 導演失敗，改用一般分配：{0}": "AI Director failed, used the normal assignment: {0}",
  "「分析影片內容」（預設開）：產生前先看過每支影片（每秒約 2 格），挑片段時避開模糊、太暗、過曝的地方和影片裡原本的剪接點；激烈的段落挑動得多的部分，安靜的段落挑穩的。也會找畫面裡的人臉並認出是誰：所有素材裡出現最多的那個人當主角（要夠明顯：有臉的畫面三成五以上有他、出現次數是第二名的兩倍），只有別人沒有主角的片段一定不用，推近和追蹤都對準主角，AI 導演也會看到每一格有沒有主角；沒有明顯的主角時，就盡量挑有人的素材和片段，有人的片段會自動打開臉部追蹤，縮放、震動這類特效的中心會跟著臉；有開「推近 / 拉遠」的話，有人的鏡頭（影片也一樣）會慢慢推近到臉上。第一次分析要一點時間，結果存在瀏覽器，之後同一個素材不用再算（重新整理也一樣）。": "Analyze footage (on by default): before generating, each video is scanned (about 2 frames per second) so segments avoid blurry, too dark or blown-out parts and cuts already inside the video; intense sections take the parts with more motion, calm sections the steadier ones. It also looks for faces and recognizes who they are: the person who appears most across all media becomes the main person (only when clear: in at least 35% of the frames with faces and seen twice as often as the runner-up), stretches with only other people are never used, push-ins and tracking aim at the main person, and the AI director sees which frames show them; without a clear main person, media and segments with people are simply preferred, and clips with people get face tracking turned on so zoom, shake and similar effects center on the face; with Push / pull on, shots with people (videos too) slowly push in on the face. The first scan takes a moment; results are kept in the browser, so the same media is not scanned again (even after a reload).",
  "「AI 導演」（要 API 金鑰；開關在 AI 助手輸入框上方）：產生前把每個素材的畫面（影片大約每 2 秒一張、標上秒數，連同檔名）和音樂段落交給 AI，由它決定每個素材適合開頭、鋪陳、高潮還是結尾、要多常用、影片裡哪幾秒最精彩、哪幾秒要避開（避開的一定不會用到，整支都避開就等於不用），素材清單旁邊會標出它的安排（「不用」= AI 覺得不適合）。想要的內容直接跟 AI 助手說，例如「開頭放風景，高潮放人物」，它會轉告導演（目前的指示顯示在開關旁邊，按 ✕ 清除）。開著時在自動剪輯面板按「產生」也會用導演。同樣的素材、音樂和指示會沿用上次的結果，不會重複呼叫 API。": "AI Director (needs an API key; the switch is above the AI assistant input): before generating, frames of each media file (about one every 2 seconds for videos, labelled with their time, plus the file name) and the song sections are sent to the AI, which decides whether each file suits the intro, build, drop or outro, how often to use it, which seconds of a video are best and which to avoid (avoided seconds are never used; a fully avoided file is skipped); its choice is shown next to each media item (Skip = the AI thinks it does not fit). Tell the AI assistant what you want, e.g. \"open with landscapes, people on the drop\", and it passes that on to the director (the current note is shown next to the switch; ✕ clears it). While it is on, Generate in the Auto Edit panel uses the director too. The same media, music and note reuse the previous result without calling the API again.",
  "修改自動剪輯設定 ×{0}": "Change auto edit settings ×{0}",
  "修改自動剪輯設定 ×{0}，產生一版": "Change auto edit settings ×{0}, then generate",
  "產生一版自動剪輯": "Generate an auto edit take",
  "在 AI 助手裡可以直接用說的改自動剪輯的設定，例如「副歌切快一點」「每拍都要晃」「閃光少一點」「轉場只用柔和的」「換成速度感」「再剪一版」：AI 會提議修改面板設定（風格、特效層、轉場權重…，按「套用」才生效），要求產生時套用後就會剪一版：過程（分析素材、AI 導演看了幾張畫面、每個素材怎麼安排、排了幾個鏡頭）會一步一步顯示在那則回覆下面，剪完 AI 會看結果跟你說明、建議下一步。": "In the AI assistant you can change Auto Edit settings by just saying so, e.g. \"cut faster in the chorus\", \"shake on every beat\", \"fewer flashes\", \"only soft transitions\", \"switch to Velocity\", \"another take\": the AI proposes changes to the panel settings (style, FX layers, transition weights…; they take effect when you press Apply), and if you ask it to generate, a take is cut after applying: each step (analyzing media, how many frames the AI director looked at, how it arranged each file, how many shots were placed) appears under that reply, and when it is done the AI reviews the result and suggests what to try next.",
  "「自動剪輯」面板（「編輯 → 自動剪輯」或「檢視」選單打開）：把音樂從素材分頁拖到「音樂」卡片（或從下拉選單選），會跳出選範圍的視窗（按住 Alt 拖 = 整首）；鉛筆可以重選範圍。按「產生」就依音樂的段落與能量剪一版，連同這段音樂一起接在時間軸最後面：安靜的地方鏡頭長、激烈的地方切得密，段落交界和 drop 用比較強的轉場，再照「特效層」疊上特效。段落條的顏色是段落種類、越亮能量越高，白線是 drop。": "Auto Edit panel (Edit → Auto Edit, or the View menu): drag a song from the Media tab onto the Music card (or pick one from the list) and a range window opens (hold Alt while dragging = the whole song); the pencil re-picks the range. Press Generate to cut a take that follows the sections and energy of the music, placed together with that stretch of music after the end of the timeline: quiet parts get long shots, intense parts are cut tightly, section boundaries and drops get stronger transitions, and effects are layered per the FX layers. Section bar colours are section kinds, brighter = more energy, white lines are drops.",
  "產生的東西放在時間軸最後面，用這段時間空著的軌道（不夠才新增；影片原音靜音），不會動到原本的內容；整次產生是一步，Ctrl+Z 就能復原。「再一版」用同樣的設定在同一個位置重新產生、換掉上一版（上一版的片段、特效、音樂被手動改過就不能用；重新整理頁面後照樣能用）。風格、特效層、轉場這類設定會記住（每個專案共用）；音樂、副歌、素材清單跟著專案存。": "The result goes after the end of the timeline, on tracks that are free there (new ones only when needed; video audio is muted), so existing content is never touched; a whole generate is one step and Ctrl+Z undoes it. Another Take regenerates with the same settings in the same place, replacing the previous take (not available once its clips, effects or music were edited by hand; still works after reloading the page). Style, FX layers and transition settings are remembered (shared by all projects); the song, chorus points and media list are saved with the project.",
  "沒有產生任何片段": "Nothing was generated",
