  "機率": "Chance",
  "「特效層」：一層是一種特效，各自放在一條特效軌；範圍和時機完全一樣的幾層會合併成同一個方塊（疊加的特效）。每層設定：特效（也可以用「我的組合」）、時機（每半拍 / 每拍 / 每 2 拍 / 每小節 = 跟著節拍重播；「每個剪接點」= 每次換鏡頭打一下；「重音」= 音樂的重拍上打一下；「drop」= drop 上打一下；「整個段落」= 整段套上，適合黑白、雙色調、顆粒這類色調）、用在哪幾種能量，和機率（每個時機點有幾成會出現；每拍 50% = 大約一半的拍子會觸發，哪幾拍是固定的）。同一類的特效（縮放、晃動、閃光、故障、色調）不會同時出現：drop > 重音 > 剪接點 > 每拍 > 整個段落，時機一樣時上面那層優先，被蓋到的那層只在那幾拍讓開；顆粒、黑邊、暗角、漏光、VHS 這類氛圍特效可以跟任何東西疊。內建風格的微弱頻閃會整段隨機變化。同一時間最多 4 種特效；drop 前一拍除了剪接震動會留白；主體跳出的那幾拍只留閃光、色調、氛圍和剪接震動。「新增」加一層，X 移除，左邊的開關暫時關掉。": "FX layers: each layer is one effect on its own FX track; layers with exactly the same range and timing are merged into one block (stacked effects). Per layer: the effect (My combos work too), when (every half beat / beat / 2 beats / bar = restarts on the beat; Every cut = hits on each shot change; Accents = hits on the strong beats of the music; drop = hits on drops; Whole section = covers the section, good for looks like B&W, duotone or grain), which energy levels it is used in, and the chance (how often each beat / cut / hit fires; every beat at 50% = about half the beats, always the same ones). Effects of the same kind (zoom, shake, flash, glitch, colour) never play at the same time: drop > accent > cut > beat > whole section, and with the same timing the upper layer wins; the losing layer only steps aside on those beats. Atmosphere effects like grain, letterbox, vignette, light leak and VHS stack with anything. In the built-in styles, subtle flicker varies randomly throughout each section. At most 4 effects run at once; the beat before a drop is left clean except for cut shakes; during a subject pop only flash, colour, atmosphere and cut shakes stay. Add adds a layer, X removes it, the switch on the left turns it off for now.",
  "觸發的「機率」讓特效只在一部分的拍子或剪接點播（例如每拍 50%）；挑中哪幾個是固定的，沒挑中的地方特效不作用，時間軸上的細線只畫挑中的。": "A trigger's Chance makes the effect play on only some of the beats or cuts (e.g. every beat at 50%); which ones are picked is fixed, the effect is off on the others, and the thin lines on the timeline show only the picked ones.",
  "{0} 個特效": "{0} effects",
  "另存風格": "Save style",
  "風格名稱": "Style name",
  "「另存風格」（風格右上角的存檔按鈕）把目前的鏡頭節奏、特效層、轉場權重、密度、強度存成自己的風格，接在內建風格後面；名稱一樣就覆蓋。選中自己的風格時可以改名、刪除；改了任何設定一樣變成「自訂」，要保留就再另存一次。自己的風格每個專案共用。": "Save style (the save button at the top right of Style) stores the current shot rhythm, FX layers, transition weights, density and strength as your own style, listed after the built-in ones; saving with an existing name overwrites it. With one of your styles selected you can rename or delete it; changing anything turns it into Custom, so save again to keep the change. Your styles are shared by all projects.",
