  '右鍵點尺規可新增、重新命名或刪除標記；M 在播放頭新增，點標記跳轉、拖曳移動，片段與播放頭可吸附標記；Shift+M / Ctrl+Shift+M 跳到上 / 下一個標記。': 'Right-click the ruler to add, rename or delete markers. M adds one at the playhead; click to jump and drag to move. Clips and the playhead snap to markers. Shift+M / Ctrl+Shift+M jumps to the previous / next marker.',
