  "儲存空間": "Storage",
  "這個網站在瀏覽器裡用掉的空間": "Space this site uses in the browser",
  "「設定 → 專案 → 儲存空間」列出這個網站在瀏覽器裡用掉多少空間（素材檔案、代理檔、去背、追蹤、自動剪輯分析、設定與自訂）；「其他」是瀏覽器算的總量多出來的部分，大多是刪掉了但瀏覽器還沒回收的資料（例如刪掉的素材），之後會自己慢慢釋放；換代理檔畫質時舊代理檔會馬上釋放。「清除所有資料…」會刪掉專案、素材、自訂的東西和所有快取，要先按確認、再輸入指定的字，一致才會刪，刪完重新載入。": "Settings → Project → Storage lists how much space this site uses in the browser (media files, proxies, cutouts, tracking, auto edit analysis, settings & custom items). \"Clear all data…\" deletes the project, media, custom items and every cache; confirm first, then type the requested text — only if it matches is everything deleted, and the page reloads. Other is how much more the browser reports in total — mostly deleted data the browser has not reclaimed yet (for example deleted media); it is released over time. Old proxies are released right away when you change proxy quality.",
  "自動剪輯時 AI 先看過素材再分配": "For auto edit, the AI looks at the media before assigning it",
  "清除指示": "Clear note",
  "匯入素材 {0}/{1}：{2}": "Importing media {0}/{1}: {2}",
