  "從這裡重來並復原修改": "Rewind and undo changes",
  "選範圍的視窗：I / Q 把入點設到播放頭、O / W 把出點設到播放頭；滑鼠移到播放頭上會亮起來，在它上面點一下（不拖）會把比較近的入點或出點移到這裡；播放中拖播放頭，放開後接著播。Home / End 跳到範圍的頭 / 尾；範圍條跟時間軸一樣：Ctrl + 滾輪縮放、滾輪左右捲動，放大後下方有捲軸（右下角的倍率按一下回到整段）。裁切框按住 Alt 拖把手 = 從中心縮放；範圍和裁切框的調整都可以 Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Y。在清單上點一列（或按鉛筆）會在預覽面板顯示那一段，有裁切的話會畫出裁切框（只能看，要改請按鉛筆）。在自動剪輯分頁改設定時預覽會先暫停。": "Range window: I / Q set the in point to the playhead, O / W set the out point. Hovering the playhead highlights it; a click on it (without dragging) moves the nearer in or out point there. Dragging the playhead while playing keeps playing after you let go. Home / End jump to the start / end of the range; the range bar works like the timeline: Ctrl + wheel zooms, the wheel scrolls sideways, and a scrollbar appears below when zoomed in (click the zoom factor at the bottom right to show it all). Alt-drag a crop handle to resize from the center; range and crop changes can be undone with Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Y. Clicking a row in the list (or the pencil) shows that range in the Preview panel with its crop frame drawn (view only; use the pencil to change it). Changing settings in the Auto Edit tab pauses the preview first.",
  "在自己的訊息上按右鍵：「複製」、「從這裡重來」（拿掉這則和之後的對話，文字放回輸入框）、「從這裡重來並復原 N 步」（專案也復原到送出這則之前；之後在別的地方復原過、分岔了就不能用）。": "Right-click your own message: Copy, Rewind to here (removes it and everything after it and puts the text back in the input), and Rewind and undo N steps (also undoes the project back to before that message; not available once the undo history has branched).",
