  "產生後不想要時間軸上的某個片段：右鍵 →「從自動剪輯素材移除」會把這個片段用到的那幾秒從素材清單扣掉（同一支影片的其他部分留著；多選可以一次扣；圖片整個移除），時間軸上的片段不動，按「再一版」就不會再用到；「在自動剪輯清單顯示」會跳到清單上的那一段，可以改範圍、裁切或改名。": "Don't want a clip the auto edit placed? Right-click → \"Remove from Auto Edit media\" removes the seconds that clip uses from the media list (the rest of the same video stays; select several to remove them at once; images are removed entirely). The clip on the timeline stays; press \"Another Take\" and it won't be used again. \"Show in Auto Edit list\" jumps to that entry so you can adjust its range, crop or name.",
