  "這裡找不到臉": "No face found here",
  "在時間軸上右鍵點片段，選「指定主角」，再到預覽畫面框住要當主角的人。所有素材都會認這個人（會用其他素材裡很像的臉一起比對，換角度也認得出來）：自動剪輯會跟著這個人、避開只有其他人的鏡頭，不用再猜主角；附近沒有主角的鏡頭不追蹤。關掉「避開沒有主角的片段」= 只有別人的片段照樣用，追蹤、推近仍然只對主角。素材卡片會顯示主角，按 X 可清除並恢復自動判斷；下次按「產生」或「再一版」時生效。": "Right-click a timeline clip, choose \"Designate lead\", then draw a box around the person in the preview. Every clip is matched against this person (similar faces from other clips are added, so other angles are recognised too): Auto Edit follows them and avoids shots with only other people, and shots without the lead nearby are not tracked. Turn off \"Skip parts without the lead\" to still use parts with only other people; tracking and push-ins still aim only at the lead. The Media card shows the lead; X clears it and returns to automatic selection. This takes effect the next time you press Generate or Another Take.",
