  "在時間軸選取東西時，「屬性」分頁會自動切到前面；選取清掉（刪除、點空白處）時切回原本的分頁（例如自動剪輯），中間自己換過分頁就不切回。": "Selecting something on the timeline brings the Properties tab to the front; when the selection is cleared (deleted, or clicking empty space) it switches back to the tab you were on (e.g. Auto Edit), unless you changed tabs yourself in between.",
