  "照風格": "Style",
  "照每個分段的指示調整自動剪輯的分段設定（set_auto_edit 的 zones；範圍和指示保留）：": "Adjust the auto edit zones following each zone's instruction (set_auto_edit zones; keep the ranges and instructions):",
