  "單擊動畫卡片會在「預覽」用示範畫面循環試看（多人範本每個人不同顏色）；Alt+點擊或右鍵「用時間軸畫面試看」改用播放頭底下的片段。卡片平常是靜態的，滑過才會動。": "Click an animation card to loop it in Preview on sample images (in group templates each person has a different colour); Alt+click or right-click → \"Preview on timeline\" uses the clip under the playhead instead. Cards are still until you hover over them.",
  "圖片區塊的標題、每一列或時間軸上的動畫方塊按右鍵：「複製圖片」複製整個圖片列表，「貼上圖片」整份貼到選取的動畫；某一列上的「複製這張」「貼到這張」只動那一張。主體依序對主體，來源的人比較少就輪流用；背景、揭露各自對同一種；分身沒有對應的就跟著主體；對不到的保留原本的圖。一次貼到好幾個動畫時照時間先後把人依序分下去（例如六個人貼到兩個「三人滑入」= 前三個、後三個）。打開「全用同一張」的動畫全部換成第一張。": "Right-click the Images header, a single row, or an animation block on the timeline: \"Copy images\" copies the whole image list and \"Paste images\" pastes all of it into the selected animations; on a row, \"Copy this one\" and \"Paste here\" touch only that image. Subjects go to subjects in order, cycling if the source has fewer people; background and reveal go to the same kind; copies without a match follow their subject; anything without a match keeps its image. Pasting into several animations hands people out in time order (e.g. six people into two Triple slides = first three, last three). Animations with \"Same for all\" on all take the first image.",
